1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,942
That meeting was thirty minutes. It felt
like ninety.

2
00:00:05,492 --> 00:00:10,463
Thirty minutes on the clock. Only five of
them decided anything.

3
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:12,961
The rest was warm up.

4
00:00:14,511 --> 00:00:19,858
Fifteen minutes of context. Ten of
discussion. Five of decision.

5
00:00:20,828 --> 00:00:22,377
Most of it was waiting.

6
00:00:23,927 --> 00:00:28,384
No agenda, no meeting. One decision per
meeting.

7
00:00:29,354 --> 00:00:32,368
If nobody can name it, do not book it.

8
00:00:33,338 --> 00:00:36,813
And send the notes after, or it did not
happen.

9
00:00:38,363 --> 00:00:42,905
A decision ends. A conversation just gets
booked again.

10
00:00:43,875 --> 00:00:47,238
Same room, same topic, next week.

11
00:00:48,788 --> 00:00:53,050
Cut the middle, or cancel the whole thing
and send a note.

12
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,903
Pick one, and stop.

13
00:00:57,453 --> 00:01:00,218
Name the decision before you book the
room.
